`/login`
page, just add a
`<form>`
— no JavaScript needed:
src/routes/login/+page
```
<form method="POST">
	<label>
		Email
		<input name="email" type="email">
	</label>
	<label>
		Password
		<input name="password" type="password">
	</label>
	<button>Log in</button>
</form>
```
