chunks.text:
The planner doesn’t consider
out-of-line storage
in cost estimates, which can make a serial scan look cheaper. You can reduce the cost of a parallel scan for a query with:
```sql
BEGIN;
SET LOCAL min_parallel_table_scan_size = 1;
SET LOCAL parallel_setup_cost = 1;
SELECT ...
COMMIT;
```
or choose to store vectors inline:
```sql
ALTER TABLE items ALTER COLUMN embedding SET STORAGE PLAIN;
```

